title: "AI for Data - Data for AI"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-06-01
authors:
  - given-names: Development Data Group
    affiliation: "World Bank Group"
abstract: "AI for Data – Data for AI is a work program of the World Bank's Development Data Group and Office of the Chief Statistician. It applies AI to the production, curation, and dissemination of development data, and it prepares development data for use by AI systems. This repository holds the Python package, the JavaScript packages, the documentation, the cookbooks, the end-to-end reference implementation, and the training materials of the program."
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - data quality
  - metadata
  - development data
  - anomaly detection
  - semantic search
  - data use monitoring
  - model context protocol
  - official statistics
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/worldbank/ai4data"
url: "https://worldbank.github.io/ai4data"
